        <div class="svc-card"><span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></span><h3 class="svc-name">Email</h3><p class="svc-desc"><a href="mailto:info@chayceproperties.com">info@chayceproperties.com</a></p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="stage-intro" style="margin-top:28px">Arrange a visit or a phone consultation by calling or emailing us. Where to start: <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help for older people</a>, <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/senior-move-manager-uk/">what a senior move manager does</a> and our <a href="/services/">services</a>.</p>
