<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Do you offer downsizing help for older people in Northampton?</summary><p>Yes. We are based in Northampton and help older people sort, pack, move and settle when downsizing, whether you are moving within the town, elsewhere in Northamptonshire or to another part of the UK.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Which areas around Northampton do you cover?</summary><p>We work with clients across Northamptonshire and the surrounding East Midlands, including Kettering, Wellingborough, Daventry, Towcester, Brackley, Rugby, Market Harborough, Milton Keynes and Bedford, as well as the rest of the UK.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I visit your Northampton office?</summary><p>Yes. Our office is at Unit F2B Barratt House, Kingsthorpe Road, Northampton NN2 6EZ, open Monday to Friday 09:00 to 17:30, closed Saturday and Sunday. Please call <a href="tel:+447708925432">07708 925432</a> first so we can make sure a coordinator is available.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does a move from Northampton cost?</summary><p>Packages start at £995 for packing and removals, with full-service moves from £1,850. A Discovery Consultation costs £150 and gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget before you commit to anything.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

